# URLs that the weekly link check skips (regular expressions, one per line).

# Star badges return 200 even for deleted repositories. The workflow checks
# those repositories through the GitHub API instead.
^https://img\.shields\.io/

# Hosts that reset the connection, fail over HTTP/2, loop through login
# redirects, or return status 999 to automated clients. Check these by hand.
^https://fred\.stlouisfed\.org/
^https://gemini\.google\.com/
^https://www\.sciencedirect\.com/
^https://([a-z0-9-]+\.)?linkedin\.com/
^https://(www\.)?(twitter|x)\.com/
